<fn-group>
  <fn id="fn1">
    <label>1</label><p>The <italic>soildynamics</italic> module builds
    upon the <italic>elastodynamics</italic> module by adding tools
    essential for earthquake modeling, such as paraxial boundary
    conditions, double-couple source mechanisms, point-cloud
    meshing-partitioning, etc.</p>
  </fn>
</fn-group>
</back>
</article>
